This repository builds on and includes adapted code from:

* nnU-Net v2 (https://github.com/MIC-DKFZ/nnUNet), Apache-2.0. The trainer in omnilesion/nnunet_trainer extends
  nnunetv2.training.nnUNetTrainer.nnUNetTrainer and reuses its data-loader construction; omnilesion/inference.py
  adapts nnunetv2.preprocessing.resampling.resample_torch.resample_torch_fornnunet.
* MONAI (https://github.com/Project-MONAI/MONAI), Apache-2.0. The lung-nodule detector is assembled from MONAI's
  RetinaNet, ResNet and anchor utilities; its configuration follows MONAI's lung_nodule_ct_detection bundle. No
  pretrained weights are used.
* dynamic-network-architectures (https://github.com/MIC-DKFZ/dynamic-network-architectures), Apache-2.0.
* The component-balanced loss is in the spirit of blob loss (Kofler et al., 2023).
* Case-level surface metrics use surface-distance (https://github.com/deepmind/surface-distance), Apache-2.0.
